Package: islhepi
Title: Epidemiological Methods for Island Health
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Temuulen", "Enebish", , "temuulen@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides validated helpers for common applied epidemiology
    tasks, including age grouping, crude and directly standardised rates,
    Poisson confidence intervals, small-cell suppression and count rounding.
    It also retrieves standardized population denominators and health-geography
    boundaries from pinned BC Data Catalogue records. Methods are explicit and
    designed for reproducible public health analysis.
